"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{}]\n1f:Ta98,<p>\n# Ventes Flash Printemps : Jean Paul Gaultier Le Male à -30%</p><p><strong>Le Male</strong> de Jean Paul Gaultier est l'un des parfums homme les plus vendus au monde depuis 1995. Le flacon 125ml passe à <strong>55€ au lieu de 79€</strong>.</p><h2>Le deal</h2><ul><li>~~79€~~ → <strong>55€</strong> soit <strong>-30%</strong> (économie de 24€)</li>\n<li><strong>Offre limitée</strong> — Ventes Flash Printemps Amazon</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.fr/s?k=Ventes%20Flash%20Printemps%20Amazon%20%3A%20Jean%20Paul%20Gaultier%20Le%20Male%20%C3%A0%20(55%E2%82%AC%20au%20lieu%20de%2079%E2%82%AC)&tag=lebrunnathali-21\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le deal sur Amazon <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Un parfum légendaire</h2><ul><li><strong>Flacon marin iconique</strong> — le torse de marin reconnaissable entre mille</li>\n<li><strong>Menthe, lavande, vanille</strong> — un accord frais et sensuel</li>\n<li><strong>Sillage puissant</strong> — on vous remarque</li>\n<li><strong>Tenue 8h+</strong> — du matin au soir</li>\n<li><strong>Depuis 1995</strong> — un classique indémodable</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"ezoic-pub-ad-placeholder-203\" class=\"ad-container\" style=\"text-align:center;margin:24px 0;min-height:90px;overflow:hidden\"></div><h2>Les notes</h2><ul><li><strong>Tête</strong> — menthe, lavande, bergamote</li>\n<li><strong>Cœur</strong> — cannelle, cumin</li>\n<li><strong>Fond</strong> — vanille, ambre, bois de santal</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"cta-inline\"><a href=\"https://www.amazon.fr/s?k=Ventes%20Flash%20Printemps%20Amazon%20%3A%20Jean%20Paul%20Gaultier%20Le%20Male%20%C3%A0%20(55%E2%82%AC%20au%20lieu%20de%2079%E2%82%AC)&tag=lebrunnathali-21\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\">Voir le deal sur Amazon <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"/><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"/><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"3\"/></svg></a></div><h2>Notre avis</h2><p>Le Male à 55€ pour 125ml, c'est <strong>cadeau</strong>. Un des meilleurs rapports qualité-prix en parfumerie masculine. Parfait pour offrir ou se faire plaisir.</p>13:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"article-content\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$1f\"}}]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{}]\n15:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"margin\":\"40px 0\",\"padding\":\"32px\",\"background\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #FFF0F0 0%, #FFF8F0 100%)\",\"borderRadius\":\"16px\",\"border\":\"2px solid #FECDD3\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":800,\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"marginBottom\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"var(--foreground)\"},\"children\":\"Profiter de cette offre\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.fr/s?k=Ventes%20Flash%20Printemps%20Amazon%20%3A%20Jean%20Paul%20Gaultier%20Le%20Male%20%C3%A0%20(55%E2%82%AC%20au%20lieu%20de%2079%E2%82%AC)&tag=lebrunnathali-21\",\"className\":\"btn btn-primary\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"nofollow sponsored noopener\",\"style\":{\"padding\":\"14px 32px\",\"fontSize\":\"1rem\"},\"children\":[\"Voir le deal sur Amazon\",\" \",[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":15,\"height\":15,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",